amage</td><td>+10 avg</td><td class=\"muted\"></td></tr></tbody></table></div>\n      <h2>Getting Superior ones</h2>\n      \n      \n      <p><b>Monster drops</b>: ordinary monsters and chests give at most Excellent; elites give only Excellent, Superior or Flawless (official guide).</p>\n      <div class=\"g-scroll\"><table class=\"g-table\"><thead><tr><th>Dropped by</th><th>Qualities recorded</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><a href=\"#/monster/mummy\">The Hollow Herald</a></td><td><span class=\"q-name q-superior\">Superior</span> 1</td></tr><tr><td><a href=\"#/monster/ogre-warchief\">Warchief Ruk Gorehand</a></td><td><span class=\"q-name q-superior\">Superior</span> 1</td></tr></tbody></table></div>\n      <button type=\"button\" class=\"show-on-map\" data-map-kind=\"item\" data-map-id=\"titanium-rapier\" data-map-quality=\"superior\">Show where it drops Superior on the map</button>\n      \n      <h2>Related</h2><p class=\"rel-row\"><b>Other materials</b> <a class=\"rel-chip\" href=\"#/item/iron-rapier\"><img class=\"q-mini\" src=\"data/img/a68aef65131cf1e56ab3.svg\" alt=\"\">Iron Rapier</a><a class=\"rel-chip\" href=\"#/item/silver-rapier\"><img class=\"q-mini\" src=\"data/img/f02f4f5eda250757c7a7.svg\" alt=\"\">Silver Rapier</a><a class=\"rel-chip\" href=\"#/item/gold-rapier\"><img class=\"q-mini\" src=\"data/img/a2b1f5a83b47581bc9e1.svg\" alt=\"\">Gold Rapier</a></p>\n      \n    </div><aside class=\"wp-infobox\"><div class=\"wp-pic q-glow-superior\"><img src=\"data/img/90842e1c199f494d84dd.svg\" alt=\"Titanium Rapier\"><span id=\"gearEnchBadge\" class=\"wp-badge\"></span></div><h3>Titanium Rapier <span class=\"q-name q-superior\">(Superior)</span></h3><table>\n      \n      <tr><th>Damage</th><td id=\"gearDmg\">20.4–47.7 damage <span class=\"muted\">(Superior)</span></td></tr>\n      <tr><th>Requires</th><td>Lvl 40 · STR 100</td></tr>\n      \n      <tr><th>Dropped by</th><td>12 monsters</td></tr>\n      \n      \n      <tr><th>Last seen</th><td>10/24/2026, 4